Z||000000||Adrift||09-12-2001||01:32 PM||||I've attempted to copy the speedo style of a ferrari 355, here's my question though: If I want the white to come up as blue (with a black background) when backlit and the yellow to come up as a white, what colors do I use for the backlit gauge image?<BR>Thanks<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Ferrari-Speedo.jpg"> ||||reg||1
